&lt;img width="1234" alt="Screen Shot 2019-09-02 at 11 14 42 PM" src="<a href="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14225158/64148208-8dab7e80-cdd7-11e9-97c5-3a4ce12cac7a.png" rel="nofollow">https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14225158/64148208-8dab7e80-cdd7-11e9-97c5-3a4ce12cac7a.png</a>"&gt;

