## What changes were proposed in this pull request?

In the PR, I propose to revert 2 commits <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/commit/06abd06112965cd73417ccceacdbd94b6b3d2793/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/commit/06abd06112965cd73417ccceacdbd94b6b3d2793"><tt>06abd06</tt></a> and <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/commit/61561c1c2d4e47191fdfe9bf3539a3db29e89fa9/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/commit/61561c1c2d4e47191fdfe9bf3539a3db29e89fa9"><tt>61561c1</tt></a>, and take current date via `LocalDate.now` in the session time zone. The result is stored as days since epoch `1970-01-01`.

