<span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This commit closes pull request #17568.">Closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="220273283" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/17568" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/17568/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/17568">#17568</a> from kiszk/SPARK-20254.

…amming join enumeration

## What changes were proposed in this pull request?

Implements star-join filter to reduce the search space for dynamic programming join enumeration. Consider the following join graph:

```
T1       D1 - T2 - T3
  \     /
    F1
     |
    D2

star-join: {F1, D1, D2}
non-star: {T1, T2, T3}
```
The following join combinations will be generated:
```
level 0: (F1), (D1), (D2), (T1), (T2), (T3)
level 1: {F1, D1}, {F1, D2}, {T2, T3}
level 2: {F1, D1, D2}
level 3: {F1, D1, D2, T1}, {F1, D1, D2, T2}
level 4: {F1, D1, D2, T1, T2}, {F1, D1, D2, T2, T3 }
level 6: {F1, D1, D2, T1, T2, T3}
```

## How was this patch tested?

New test suite ```StarJOinCostBasedReorderSuite.scala```.

