Additionally in Spark Shell:

```scala
case class QueueClass(q: scala.collection.immutable.Queue[Int])

spark.createDataset(Seq(List(1,2,3))).map(x => QueueClass(scala.collection.immutable.Queue(x: _*))).map(_.q.dequeue).collect
