## What changes were proposed in this pull request?

When do the QA work, I found that the following issues:

1). `spark.mlp` doesn't include an example;
2). `spark.mlp` and `spark.lda` have redundant parameter explanations;
3). `spark.lda` document misses default values for some parameters.

I also changed the `spark.logit` regParam in the examples, as we discussed in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="194475290" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/16222" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/16222/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/16222">#16222</a>.

