## What changes were proposed in this pull request?
Likewise [DataSet.scala](<a href="https://github.com/apache/spark/blob/master/sql/core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/sql/Dataset.scala#L156">https://github.com/apache/spark/blob/master/sql/core/src/main/scala/org/apache/spark/sql/Dataset.scala#L156</a>) KeyValueGroupedDataset should mark the queryExecution as transient.

As mentioned in the Jira ticket, without transient we saw serialization issues like

```
Caused by: java.io.NotSerializableException: org.apache.spark.sql.execution.QueryExecution
Serialization stack:
        - object not serializable (class: org.apache.spark.sql.execution.QueryExecution, value: ==
```

