<span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This commit closes pull request #10404.">Closes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="123181071" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/10404" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/10404/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/10404">#10404</a> from rxin/SPARK-11807.

Updates made in SPARK-11206 missed an edge case which cause's a NullPointerException when a task is killed. In some cases when a task ends in failure taskMetrics is initialized as null (see JobProgressListener.onTaskEnd()). To address this a null check was added. Before the changes in SPARK-11206 this null check was called at the start of the updateTaskAccumulatorValues() function.

