message_body_html:
…be immutable

It might be dangerous to have a mutable as value for default param. (<a href="http://stackoverflow.com/a/11416002/1170730" rel="nofollow">http://stackoverflow.com/a/11416002/1170730</a>)

e.g

    def func(example, f={}):
        f[example] = 1
        return f

    func(2)

    {2: 1}
    func(3)
    {2:1, 3:1}

mengxr

