…ft server test suites

This is a follow-up of <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="58508450" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/4720" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/4720/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/4720">#4720</a>. By default, `spark-daemon.sh` writes PID files under `/tmp`, which makes it impossible to start multiple server instances simultaneously. This PR sets `SPARK_PID_DIR` to Spark home directory to workaround this problem.

Many thanks to chenghao-intel for pointing out this issue!

