This PR removes the deprecated `ParquetQuerySuite`, renamed `ParquetQuerySuite2` to `ParquetQuerySuite`, and refactored changes introduced in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="54849640" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/4115" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/4115/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/4115">#4115</a> to `ParquetFilterSuite` . It is a follow-up of <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="51446395" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/3644" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/3644/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/3644">#3644</a>.

Notice that test cases in the old `ParquetQuerySuite` have already been well covered by other test suites introduced in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load issue title" data-id="51446395" data-permission-text="Issue title is private" data-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/issues/3644" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/apache/spark/pull/3644/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/pull/3644">#3644</a>.

