Simple way to reproduce this in the UI:

```scala
val f = new java.io.File("/tmp/test")
f.delete()
sc.parallelize(1 to 2, 2).map(x =&gt; (x,x )).repartition(3).mapPartitionsWithContext { case (context, iter) =&gt;
  if (context.partitionId == 0) {
    val f = new java.io.File("/tmp/test")
    if (!f.exists) {
      f.mkdir()
      System.exit(0);
    }
  }
  iter
}.count()
```

