<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/apache/spark/commit/c6058bd056a76dbc854362d55fb0feefc5b47c5f/hovercard" href="https://github.com/apache/spark/commit/c6058bd056a76dbc854362d55fb0feefc5b47c5f"><tt>c6058bd</tt></a> [Kan Zhang] Fixing a race condition in event listener unit test

actually, the value 8 is only valid in mesos fine-grained mode :
&lt;code&gt;
  override def defaultParallelism() = sc.conf.getInt("spark.default.parallelism", 8)
&lt;/code&gt;

while in coarse-grained model including mesos coares-grained, the value of the property depending on core numbers!
&lt;code&gt;
override def defaultParallelism(): Int = {
   conf.getInt("spark.default.parallelism", math.max(totalCoreCount.get(), 2))
  }
&lt;/code&gt;

